;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
;All King Pot files

*begin KingPot

*cs OSGB:SD
*cs out EPSG:27700
*DECLINATION AUTO 70793.56 77377.74 368.43

*INCLUDE KingPot-recon1		;centreline data reconstructed from NCC survey using Patric Warren's Inkscape plugin
*INCLUDE KingPot-recon2		;centreline data reconstructed from NCC survey using Patric Warren's Inkscape plugin
*INCLUDE Upstream-recon1	;centreline data reconstructed from CDG sketch using Patric Warren's Inkscape plugin
*INCLUDE Upstream-recon2	;centreline data reconstructed from CDG sketch using Patric Warren's Inkscape plugin
*INCLUDE Upstream-recon3   	;centreline data reconstructed from CDG sketch using Patric Warren's Inkscape plugin
*INCLUDE DownstreamSumpRSkorupka	

*EQUATE 	entrance KingPot-recon1.path3.0
*ENTRANCE	entrance
*FIX		entrance 70793.56 77377.74 368.43 ;this is the location of Kevin Dixons GPS bolt at the entrance of King POT
; Data for the Kevin Dixon gps reading is in westkingsdale-gps-kdixon-2012 and is 70788.934	77381.486	372.604 for the antenna base

*EQUATE	KingPot-recon1.path3.80	KingPot-recon2.path2.0
*EQUATE	KingPot-recon2.path7.5	DownstreamSumpRSkorupka.DS-Surface
*EQUATE KingPot-recon2.path11.5	Upstream-recon1.0
*EQUATE Upstream-recon1.23		Upstream-recon2.4
*EQUATE Upstream-recon2.43 		Upstream-recon3.0

*end KingPot
